{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1521832-w20-ananasi","id":1521832,"title":"W20 Ananasi","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-09-01T13:27:15-07:00","id":1521832,"title":"W20 Ananasi","content":"Converting temp renown to perm.<br /> <br /> Rite of Appeal just lets you go up in rank, but it reads like the rite of accomplishment only without the conversion.<br /> <br /> In the game I'm in as an ananasi, temp converts to perm if your tenth dot is because of a great or significant deed or you perform such a deed soon after.<br /> <br /> Does anyone have any other options?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23984-thkaal","name":"Thkaal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-01T18:28:55-07:00","id":1521845,"title":"","content":"Why wouldn't the Ananasi also have The Rite of Accomplishment? Rite of Appeal is what gets you a higher Rank.<br /> <br /> If your ST wants a different system to advance renown, you should talk with them what works. As someone who did the automatic dot for a long time, I can tell you it can lead to a ridiculous level of renown gathering in the game. To the point that in any game I ran it like that I had to actually raise Rank minimums for it to work out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avata